# Shell scripts MUST stay LF. Git's Windows default (core.autocrlf=true) rewrites
# them to CRLF on checkout, and then the shebang itself breaks:
#     /usr/bin/env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory
# Verified on WSL2 2026-07-29 — a CRLF copy would not start at all.
* text=auto eol=lf
agent-tools text eol=lf
install.sh  text eol=lf
*.sh        text eol=lf
*.md        text eol=lf
